{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001819994","cik":"0001819994","slug":"rocket-lab-819994","name":"Rocket Lab Corp","ticker":"RKLB","exchanges":["Nasdaq"],"sector":"Guided Missiles & Space Vehicles & Parts","sic":"3760","country":"CA","website":"","listed_years":5.3,"first_annual":"2021-03-31","last_filing":"2026-07-31","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001819994&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["Rocket Lab Corp files with the SEC under \"Guided Missiles & Space Vehicles & Parts\", based in CA, and has been publicly reporting for 5 years.","It reported $622.5m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 63.5% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 38.2%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 125 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 63.5% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $200.3m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1819994/000181999426000028/0001819994-26-000028-index.htm","accession":"0001819994-26-000028"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1819994/000181999426000028/0001819994-26-000028-index.htm","accession":"0001819994-26-000028"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 28.8% to 38.2% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1819994/000181999426000028/0001819994-26-000028-index.htm","accession":"0001819994-26-000028"},{"text":"Net cash of $1.4bn against total assets of $2.8bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1819994/000181999426000028/0001819994-26-000028-index.htm","accession":"0001819994-26-000028"}],"bear":[{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-27.9% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1819994/000181999426000028/0001819994-26-000028-index.htm","accession":"0001819994-26-000028"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 19.7% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1819994/000181999426000028/0001819994-26-000028-index.htm","accession":"0001819994-26-000028"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 41.2% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (3,590,687 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1819994/000200101126000109/0002001011-26-000109-index.htm"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.8% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1819994/000200101126000109/0002001011-26-000109-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 30.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.3,"consecutive":2,"current":0.382,"current_display":"38.2%","threshold_display":"30.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than noise. Two consecutive 